{"uid":"5edd732d0d1057f6","name":"test_run_list_tasks_column_renders_flags_and_sorts_on_progress","fullName":"tests.test_browser_hub#test_run_list_tasks_column_renders_flags_and_sorts_on_progress","historyId":"e0404c9675f3658739736bd7c08416bc","time":{"start":1791978937376,"stop":1791978953783,"duration":16407},"description":"Task 014 (#21): the hub run list has a TASKS column.\n\n    #21's complaint is that the list says a run is `running` without saying\n    how far through its plan it is, so the operator has to open each run. The\n    column shows the fraction the server rendered (`tasksDisplay`, task 013 ->\n    `engine.state.format_task_fraction`) plus the trouble flags in\n    `format_task_counts`' exact wording -- never a second JS spelling of\n    either.\n\n    Asserted from an ON-DISK snapshot with no container (the fraction must be\n    just as available for a finished run as for a live one), for the four\n    honest renderings: mid-plan with something in flight, a plan stuck on a\n    failed validation, a finished plan, and a run with no plan at all -- which\n    is BLANK, never `0/0`, and sorts last ascending because \"no plan\" is not\n    \"0% done\".\n\n    The fixtures are chosen so the sort can only pass on the completion\n    RATIO: sorting the rendered cell text (\"1/4\" < \"100/250\" < \"2/2\" < \"5/7\")\n    or the bare numerator (1, 5, 2, 100) each yields a different, plausible-\n    looking order.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 014 (#21): the hub run list has a TASKS column.</p>\n<pre><code>#21's complaint is that the list says a run is `running` without saying\nhow far through its plan it is, so the operator has to open each run. The\ncolumn shows the fraction the server rendered (`tasksDisplay`, task 013 -&gt;\n`engine.state.format_task_fraction`) plus the trouble flags in\n`format_task_counts`' exact wording -- never a second JS spelling of\neither.\n\nAsserted from an ON-DISK snapshot with no container (the fraction must be\njust as available for a finished run as for a live one), for the four\nhonest renderings: mid-plan with something in flight, a plan stuck on a\nfailed validation, a finished plan, and a run with no plan at all -- which\nis BLANK, never `0/0`, and sorts last ascending because &quot;no plan&quot; is not\n&quot;0% done&quot;.\n\nThe fixtures are chosen so the sort can only pass on the completion\nRATIO: sorting the rendered cell text (&quot;1/4&quot; &lt; &quot;100/250&quot; &lt; &quot;2/2&quot; &lt; &quot;5/7&quot;)\nor the bare numerator (1, 5, 2, 100) each yields a different, plausible-\nlooking order.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791978627538,"stop":1791978627538,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791978627539,"stop":1791978627539,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791978937373,"stop":1791978937374,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791978937373,"stop":1791978937373,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791978937374,"stop":1791978937374,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"should